    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d341">

                <pb facs="0419" n="407" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg407"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 E.W./9–944</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Joint Chiefs of Staff to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-09">9 September,
                        1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: Reference is made to the
                    letter of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of 6 September 1944 regarding Armistice
                    Terms for Bulgaria, as set forth in your memoranda dated 26 and 30 August.
                        1944.<anchor n="75" xml:id="d341-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Subsequent to the forwarding of this letter, the Combined Chiefs of Staff have
                    considered this matter and recommend that the following sentence be added to
                    Article 13 of the Armistice Terms: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“These instructions and requirements will be communicated to the
                            Bulgarian Government by an Allied control commission which will be
                            appointed in Bulgaria for that purpose.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>For the Joint Chiefs of Staff: <lb/>
                    <signed>G. C. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chief of Staff, U.S. Army</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d341-f1" n="75" xml:id="d341-f1-content">
                <p>Memoranda not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
